#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use IBM Cloud Identity Access Management (IAM) to manage users with or "
"without an IBM Cloud account"
msgstr ""
"Gamitin ang IBM Cloud Identity Access Management (IAM) para pamahalaan ang "
"mga gumagamit na may o walang IBM Cloud account"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Manage ID provider users"
msgstr "Pamahalaan ang mga gumagamit ng ID provider"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Manage ID provider users {#manage-id-provider-users}"
msgstr ""
"Pamahalaan ang mga gumagamit ng ID provider {#manage-id-provider-users}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can integrate with your external identity provider (IDP) to securely "
"authenticate external users to your IBM Cloud account. By using an external "
"provider, you can provide a way for users in your company to use single "
"sign-on (SSO). You can connect your cloud account to an external IDP one of "
"the following ways:\n"
msgstr ""
"Maaari kang mag-integrate sa iyong panlabas na identity provider (IDP) para "
"ligtas na ma-authenticate ang mga panlabas na gumagamit sa iyong IBM Cloud "
"account. Sa pamamagitan ng panlabas na provider, maibibigay mo sa mga "
"gumagamit sa iyong kumpanya ang paraan para gumamit ng single sign-on (SSO)."
" Maaari mong ikonekta ang iyong cloud account sa isang panlabas na IDP sa "
"isa sa mga sumusunod na paraan:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the [IBM Cloud&reg; SAML service provider "
"(SP)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-"
"integration#federate-cloud-saml)\n"
msgstr ""
"Gamitin ang [IBM Cloud&reg; SAML service provider "
"(SP)](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-"
"integration#federate-cloud-saml)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use [App ID](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-"
"integration#federate-appid) (might incur a cost)\n"
msgstr ""
"Gamitin ang [App ID](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-"
"idp-integration#federate-appid) (maaaring magkaroon ng bayad)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Federate your users to all IBM&reg; products with "
"IBMid](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-"
"integration#federate-ibmid)\n"
msgstr ""
"[I-federate ang iyong mga gumagamit sa lahat ng produkto ng IBM&reg; gamit "
"ang IBMid](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-"
"integration#federate-ibmid)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"After connecting your IDP, you can set up dynamic rules so you don't have to manually add every user to every group when they join.  See [Enabling authentication from an external identity provider](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#app-id-dynamic-rules) for instructions.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\">\n"
"Pagkatapos ikonekta ang iyong IDP, maaari kang mag-set up ng mga dynamic na panuntunan para hindi mo na kailangang manu-manong idagdag ang bawat gumagamit sa bawat grupo kapag sila ay sumali. Tingnan ang [Enabling authentication from an external identity provider](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration#app-id-dynamic-rules) para sa mga tagubilin.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Next steps {#next-steps}"
msgstr "Mga susunod na hakbang {#next-steps}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Recommendations\">\n"
"   * Refer to the [Enabling authentication from an external identity provider](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration) topic.\n"
"   * See [IBM Cloud SAML Federation Guide](https://www.ibm.com/products/tutorials/ibm-cloud-saml-federation-guide) for more information.\n"
"   * Refer to the full [App ID documentation](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/appid?topic=appid-getting-started).\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"tip\" title=\"Mga Rekomendasyon\">\n"
"   * Basahin ang paksang [Enabling authentication from an external identity provider](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/account?topic=account-ibm-idp-integration).\n"
"   * Tingnan ang [IBM Cloud SAML Federation Guide](https://www.ibm.com/products/tutorials/ibm-cloud-saml-federation-guide) para sa karagdagang impormasyon.\n"
"   * Sumangguni sa buong [App ID documentation.](https://cloud.ibm.com/docs/appid?topic=appid-getting-started)\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
